@startuml MC02-mcp-mutate-requirement-version
!include ../includes/C4_Sequence_Macros.puml

title MC02 — ReqALM MCP: mutating tool with desk attached\n**draft** update_draft (NOT mint successor — see D39d)

C4Seq_McpHost()
C4Seq_ReqAlmMcp()
C4Seq_WebUI()
C4Seq_RouteGuard()
C4Seq_API()
C4Seq_RBAC()
C4Seq_Business()
C4Seq_Data()
C4Seq_Postgres()
C4Seq_DeskSocket()
C4Seq_Audit()
C4Seq_OTEL()

note over seqMcpHost, seqWebUI
  Preconditions: MC01 complete —
  MCP session authenticated, desk attached,
  browser tab on same client-scoped desk.
  **Draft vs mint:** this path is in-place
  draft field edit (requirement:version:update_draft).
  Successor .N with mint_kind → **D39d**.
end note

== Mutating MCP tool (HTTPS only, not desk socket) ==

seqMcpHost -> seqMcpServer : tool update_requirement_draft\n(uid, field, value)
ControlNote(seqMcpServer, "AC-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Tool invocation bound to authenticated MCP session + attached desk context")

seqMcpServer -> seqAPI : PATCH /clients/{clientId}/requirements/{uid}/versions/{n}
note over seqMcpServer, seqAPI
  Client Scoped View filters queries
  server-side; never trust client-only filters.
  MCP carries same client scope as attached desk.
end note
ControlNote(seqAPI, "SC-8", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Mutations via OpenAPI HTTPS like UI; MCP does not write over WSS")

seqAPI -> seqBusiness : updateDraftVersion(actor, clientId, uid, n, patch)
ControlNote(seqBusiness, "AC-3, CM-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Draft-only in-place edit; does not mint .N or clear ApprovalRecord")

== ActionHook pipeline (ARCH-HOOK-EVAL) ==

RbacCheck("requirement:version:update_draft")
ControlNote(seqRBAC, "AC-3, AC-6", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Same RBAC op family as Author UI; client scope enforced")

HookEval("requirement:version:update_draft")
ControlNote(seqData, "CM-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Profile may bind empty gates_before for draft edit; still evaluate via HookEval")

' Draft edit typically has empty gates_before; show pattern for consistency
note right of seqBusiness
  Draft update ≠ mint: no mint_kind,
  no gate-noop-successor-block,
  no clear_line_approval / planning_blocked.
end note

seqBusiness -> seqData : updateRequirementVersion(draft patch)
seqData -> seqPostgres : UPDATE requirement_version … WHERE client_id = scope
ControlNote(seqPostgres, "AC-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "SoT write with client boundary")
seqPostgres --> seqData : ok
seqData --> seqBusiness : updated row

HookEffectsAfter("audit")
AuditLog("requirementVersionUpdated", "uid.n field source=mcp")
ControlNote(seqAudit, "AU-2, AU-3, AU-12", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Auditable agent write distinguishable from human UI")

seqBusiness --> seqAPI : DTO
seqAPI --> seqMcpServer : tool result (structuredContent)
seqMcpServer --> seqMcpHost : ok + revision

== Live desk feedback (session-sealed push) ==

seqBusiness -> seqDeskWs : push sealed desk_frame\n(preview/cursor/agent_status)
ControlNote(seqDeskWs, "SC-23, SC-8", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "OC ADR 0018 pattern: HPKE seal to session key; type in AAD; no RPC on socket")

seqDeskWs --> seqWebUI : decrypt + render draft change
ControlNote(seqWebUI, "AC-3", "TBD (ASD V6R4)", "Human tab shows agent edit; Layout route unchanged")

@enduml
